  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organic Coffee Production Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">David &amp; Family Ltd is a company involved in the coffee sector in Huye, southern province. It was founded by Mr. David Rubanzangabo, after a long experience in the sector gained over 10 years working for SPREAD/PEARL, to promote coffee growing among farmers in Huye as a way to grow his company and help farmers improve their livelihoods. They work with 1,187 farmers in small groups, under 5-year agreements (renewable) signed with each group. David organizes competitions to reward the best farmers as a way to motivate them. He is engaged in CSR activities by distributing animals in events such as the one mentioned, also in getting solar energy and water access where needed. They export green coffee; they also sell roasted coffee on local market, a very successful brand: &quot;Huye Mountain Coffee&quot;. They want to increase production through increased productivity per tree; they also want to involve more and more youth in the sector as a way to help them find jobs and earn income, and eventually take over from the aging farmers; the company will need to set up a nursery. They also want to get certification.</narrative>
  </description>
